# Nautilus sidebar bookmarks (GTK3 format)
# One bookmark per line: file:///path Name
#
# Note: '#' is NOT a comment character in GTK's bookmark format — this file
# is installed verbatim. Delete these lines before use.
#
# Example:
# sftp://myserver/home/myuser home@myserver
# file:///home/myuser/Documents Documents
# file:///home/myuser/games Games
# file:///home/myuser/projects Projects
